{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03564","headline":"奉和人日清晖阁宴羣臣遇雪应制 · 李峤","name":"奉和人日清晖阁宴羣臣遇雪应制","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三阳偏胜节，七日最灵辰。\n行庆传芳蚁，升高缀彩人。\n阶前蓂候月，楼上雪惊春。\n今日衔天造，还疑上汉津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李峤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03564.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03564","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}